OL,3,AGoogle rejects UK request for Russell  
OL,4,ABrand YouTube video to be removed,     
OL,5,Asources say                            
OL,7,FGoogle has refused a government request
OL,8,Fto remove a YouTube video posted by    
OL,9,Fjailed rapist Russell Brand's wife in  
OL,10,Fwhich he claims his innocence,         
OL,11,FWhitehall sources have told the BBC.   
OL,13,FThe disgraced comedian is in prison    
OL,14,Fafter being sentenced to 10-and-a-half 
OL,15,Fyears following his conviction for rape
OL,16,Fand three counts of sexual assault.    
OL,18,FAndy Burnham's official spokesperson   
OL,19,Fsaid the PM believed "the public have  
OL,20,Fheard enough from Russell Brand", and  
OL,21,Fhis victims "now deserve peace from    
OL,22,Fhim".                                  
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
