OL,3,AGoogle rejects UK request for Russell  
OL,4,ABrand YouTube video to be removed,     
OL,5,Asources say                            
OL,7,FGoogle told BBC News in a statement it 
OL,8,Fwas "aware of the new content and our  
OL,9,Fteams are investigating".              
